msgid "This page shows how to control the antenna tracker, mostly using the Mission Planner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:11
#: 52874330dd8e48ba936082bd688f4f84
msgid "Control Modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:13
#: 5dc3d4b7632546958d568ebf46adaf0c
msgid "There are five modes that you can place the antenna tracker in:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:15
#: 7dbbe6724b58456e843cf2db9dcf1ac5
msgid "**Manual**: the operator directly controls the pan and tilt of the antenna tracker to manually point it at the vehicle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:17
#: 703e95cecac64a3dbd7a5d799146950f
msgid "**Stop**: the tracker does not move"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:18
#: c5f6253f554a45828a806b1893a9b3b7
msgid "**Scan**: the tracker automatically scans looking for the vehicle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:19
#: 5107c8a5a6e5467ebd0177ccda858b6f
msgid "**Auto**: the tracker attempts to track the vehicle, scanning if it ever loses contact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:21
#: 711ba8bc7b054a7d965d350e16a0ecda
msgid "**Servo_Test**: the servos are moved to the pwm values specified by a do-set-servo MAVLink command.  Used by the mission planner's extended tuning screen when the user pushes the \"test\" buttons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-operate.rst:25
#: fe8b24e87b374f6c9f791d61d7a34c62
msgid "The operator can set the current mode from the Mission Planner's Flight Data screen's Actions tab's Set Mode button.."
msgstr ""
